{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14402","headline":"孤鸿篇 · 戴叔伦","name":"孤鸿篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上双飞鸿，饮啄行相随。\n翔风一何厉，中道伤其雌。\n顾影明月下，哀鸣声正悲。\n已无矰𥐊患，岂乏稻梁资\n嗈嗈慕俦匹，远集清江湄。\n中有孤文鵷，翩翩好容仪。\n共欣相知遇，毕志同栖迟。\n野田鸱鴞鸟，相妒复相疑。\n鸿志不汝较，奋翼起高飞。\n焉随腐鼠欲，负此云霄期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}